n of a post back to where it originally came from. Costs 2.", "parameters": {"type": "object", "properties": {"post_id": {"title": "Post Id", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["post_id"], "title": "trace_originArguments"}}}\n{"type": "function", "function": {"name": "update_belief", "description": "Set your credence (0-1) that a claim\'s statement is true, with a short reason. Free.", "parameters": {"type": "object", "properties": {"claim_id": {"title": "Claim Id", "type": "string"}, "credence": {"title": "Credence", "type": "number"}, "reason": {"default": "", "title": "Reason", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["claim_id", "credence"], "title": "update_beliefArguments"}}}\n</tools>\n\nFor each function call, return a json object with function name and arguments within <tool_call></tool_call> XML tags:\n<tool_call>\n{"name": <function-name>, "arguments": <args-json-object>}\n</tool_call><|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\nYou live in the Ostmarch region. Over the past week your news feed has filled up with posts about local issues.\n\nThese are your beliefs. Your job is to end with the most accurate picture of what is actually true in this region.\n\nYOUR BELIEFS (your credence, 0 to 1, that each statement is true):\nC01 (0.93) The Ostmarch hospital staff contract stayed within the Ostmarch health budget forecast.\nC02 (0.18) The Treve Polymers plant at Pellmoor stayed within its permitted emissions limit all of last year.\nC03 (0.68) Delays at the Doran-Mirest checkpoint average under 8 minutes.\nC04 (0.32) Late-night assaults in central Saltreach did not fall after the Saltreach late-night licensing curfew began.\nC05 (0.18) The Morrowgate Fields housing development stayed within the wetland area its permit allowed.\nC06 (0.32) Venue closures in Saltreach increased after the Saltreach late-night licensing curfew.\nC07 (0.93) All of the Morrowgate services levy was spent on the services it was raised for.\nC08 (0.66) Ridership on the Ostmarch regional rail link has met it